# F0 hosted-find plus E0.1 capability receipt. Pin example.com to Weld, then
# drive Chromium's own find implementation through the same Turnstone field
# and observation model.
# Run with --features weld, TURNSTONE_CEF_PATH, and a fresh profile.
settle 30
key escape
open https://example.com/
settle 40
act Open Apparatus pane
settle 5
click-row weld.chromium
settle 5
act Toggle live content
settle 90
assert content-live
assert snap document-find-capability == supported
assert snap page-zoom-capability ~ partial
assert snap page-capture-capability ~ unavailable
assert snap navigation-capability == supported

key ctrl+f
type documentation
settle 20
assert snap document-find-query == documentation
assert snap document-find-count == 1
assert snap document-find-current == 1
assert a11y searchinput: Find in document = documentation
assert a11y status: 1 of 1
key enter
settle 10
assert snap document-find-current == 1
capture 01_weld_retained_find
log F0 hosted Weld find receipt complete
